    "text_full": "Skip to content\nAU\nNZ\nUS\nContact Us\ninfo@webzoneexpertz.com.au\n0483 915 095\n60 Mins Free Strategy Session\nHome\nAbout Us\nServices\nOpen Services\nPackages\nPortfolio\nOpen Portfolio\nReach Us\nWebsite Design Cost Calculator\nProject Type *\nPlease fill out this field.\nInformational Website\nE-commerce Website\nBlog/Personal Website\nPortfolio Website\nCustom Web Application\nNumber of Pages\nPlease choose an option\n1-5 Pages\n6-10 Pages\n11-20 Pages\n21-50 Pages\n50+ Pages\nDesign Complexity *\nPlease choose an option:\nBasic\nStandard\nCustom/Advanced\nResponsive Design *\nPlease choose an option:\nYes\nNo\nContent Management System (CMS) *\nPlease choose an option:\nWordPress\nShopify\nJoomla\nCustom CMS\nNo CMS\nE-commerce Features *\nPlease choose an option:\nShopping Cart\nPayment Gateway Integration\nCustomer Accounts\nNo E-commerce Features\nSEO Optimization *\nPlease choose an option:\nBasic SEO\nAdvanced SEO\nNone\nThird-Party Integrations\nPlease choose an option:\nSocial Media\nEmail Marketing\nCRM Integration\nAnalytics Tools\nNo Integrations\nAdditional Features\nPlease choose an option:\nBlog\nContact Forms\nLive Chat\nEvent Calendar\nNewsletter Signup\nCustom Features (Please Specify)\nCustom Features\nName\nEmail\nContact Number\nGet a Website Quote\n\nWhat Is A Website Design & SEO Cost Calculator\n\nThis free cost calculator has been designed to get a rough estimate for your website and SEO ventures. It defines an approximate investment in no time. Take the guesswork out of budgeting for your online success with our Free Website and SEO Cost Calculator.\n\nThis intuitive tool is designed to give you a clear, tailored estimate of what it takes to build a professional website and optimise it for search engines. Whether you’re a startup, small business, or large enterprise, the calculator considers your unique needs, like website features, design complexity, and SEO goals.\n\nOur Free Website & SEO Cost Calculator Options\n\nLet us take you through the options available so that you can find the best estimate based on your requirements. This tool is perfect for entrepreneurs, marketers, and decision-makers who need a quick and accurate snapshot of digital project costs.\n\nProject Type\n\nDefine your project category (e.g., business website or e-commerce) to tailor costs and requirements effectively.\n\nDesign Complexity\n\nChoose the type of design you want for your website to have a fair idea of the intricacy & resources.\n\nContent Management System\n\nAllows easy updates to site content using platforms like WordPress, Drupal, or custom CMS solutions.\n\nSEO Options\n\nEnhances search engine rankings through keyword research, meta tags, and site structure for better visibility.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nCovers optional functionalities like blogs, contact forms, or portfolios to enrich the website experience.\n\nNumber of Pages\n\nSpecify the total pages needed that influence development time, design complexity, and content creation costs.\n\nResponsive Design\n\nJust with a simple “Yes” or “No”, ensure your website adapts seamlessly across devices, improving user experience and accessibility.\n\nE-commerce Features\n\nIncludes shopping carts, payment gateways, and product listings to support online sales and transactions.\n\nThird-party Integrations\n\nConnects tools like CRMs, analytics, or payment processors to streamline workflows and enhance functionality.\n\nCustom Features\n\nHelp us know if you have a unique, tailor-made element like animations or specific tools to meet niche project requirements.\n\nWhy Use Our Free Calculator For Project Estimate?\n\nSkip the hassle of endless research with our easy-to-use calculator. It helps you plan your investment effectively, eliminates surprises, and provides transparency into the factors driving costs. Customise your estimate to suit your unique project needs and make informed decisions with confidence—quickly and effortlessly!\n\nSimplify your budgeting process with our intuitive tool. Skip the hassle of endless research and get accurate, personalised estimates in minutes.\n\nNo need to research endless pricing options\nPlan your investment effectively without surprises\nUnderstand the factors driving costs\nTailor your project to your needs\n\nBank Name : Westpac Bank\nAccount Name : Webzone Expertz\nBSB : 033 254\nAccount Number : 777099\n\nAccount Name : Webzone Expertz\nBSB : 774-001\nAccount Number : 240526241\n\nOur Certificates\nHave Questions? Feel Free To Ask Us!\nFree Consultation\nWEBSITE DEVELOPMENT\nWebsite Development Melbourne\nWebsite Development Sydney\nWebsite Development Perth\nWebsite Development Adelaide\nCustom Website Development Australia\nSmall Business Website Development\nE-commerce Website Development\nWordPress Website Development\nWeb Application Development\nWEBSITE DESIGN\nWebsite Design Melbourne\nWebsite Design Sydney\nWebsite Design Perth\nWebsite Design Adelaide\nProfessional Website Designers Australia\nBusiness Website Design Services\nMOBILE APPLICATION\nMobile App Development Melbourne\nMobile App Development Sydney\nMobile App Development Perth\nMobile App Development Adelaide\nAndroid App Development\niOS App Development\nHybrid Mobile App Development\nSEO SERVICES\nSEO Services Melbourne\nSEO Services Sydney\nSEO Services Perth\nSEO Services Adelaide\nLocal SEO Services Australia\nSmall Business SEO Services\nE-commerce SEO Services\nTechnical SEO Services\nDIGITAL MARKETING\nPPC Management Melbourne\nPPC Management Sydney\nPPC Management Perth\nPPC Management Adelaide\nGoogle Ads Management\nSocial Media Marketing Services\nBRANDING & DESIGN\nLogo Design Melbourne\nLogo Design Sydney\nLogo Design Perth\nLogo Design Adelaide\nBrand Identity Design\nBrochure Design\nBusiness Card Design\nHOSTING & SUPPORT\nDomain Hosting Services\nWebsite Hosting Australia\nBusiness Email Hosting\nWebsite Maintenance Services\nWebsite Speed Optimization\nIMPORTANT PAG